{"video_id":"VhfAVA3BG2I","title":"How Transformers Finally Ate Vision – Isaac Robinson, Roboflow","conference":"ai-engineer","language":"en","auto_generated":true,"source":"supa","timing":"exact","word_count":2383,"segments":[{"start":14.52,"duration":3.84,"text":"Hi, I'm Isaac Robinson. I'm the research"},{"start":16.48,"duration":4.28,"text":"lead at Roboflow and I'm here to talk to"},{"start":18.36,"duration":4.64,"text":"you today about how transformers finally"},{"start":20.76,"duration":3.96,"text":"ate vision."},{"start":23.0,"duration":3.68,"text":"Uh"},{"start":24.72,"duration":4.12,"text":"So, I'm going to start off with a brief"},{"start":26.68,"duration":3.64,"text":"summary of"},{"start":28.84,"duration":2.2,"text":"the competition."},{"start":30.32,"duration":2.24,"text":"Then we're going to go through an"},{"start":31.04,"duration":3.92,"text":"overview of"},{"start":32.56,"duration":4.28,"text":"the evolution of the transformer,"},{"start":34.96,"duration":5.16,"text":"why that ended up winning out, some"},{"start":36.84,"duration":4.92,"text":"consequences of that, and what's next."},{"start":40.12,"duration":2.96,"text":"So,"},{"start":41.76,"duration":3.48,"text":"where we started, convolutional neural"},{"start":43.08,"duration":3.48,"text":"networks. I'm sure everyone here is"},{"start":45.24,"duration":3.28,"text":"aware of how these work, but just to"},{"start":46.56,"duration":3.48,"text":"summarize,"},{"start":48.52,"duration":4.0,"text":"they have excellent inductive bias"},{"start":50.04,"duration":4.76,"text":"motivated by looking at how the eye"},{"start":52.52,"duration":4.92,"text":"works. So, you have a"},{"start":54.8,"duration":5.92,"text":"a filter that you convolve against your"},{"start":57.44,"duration":4.72,"text":"image, and you have activations that"},{"start":60.72,"duration":3.2,"text":"light up"},{"start":62.16,"duration":3.44,"text":"the same way regardless of where in the"},{"start":63.92,"duration":3.88,"text":"image the thing is happening. Great"},{"start":65.6,"duration":3.6,"text":"inductive bias. A person in an image is"},{"start":67.8,"duration":3.52,"text":"a person regardless of whether they're"},{"start":69.2,"duration":3.88,"text":"in the upper left or the bottom right."},{"start":71.32,"duration":4.04,"text":"And you we build these uh interesting"},{"start":73.08,"duration":4.6,"text":"hierarchical structures out of these,"},{"start":75.36,"duration":3.72,"text":"ResNets etc."},{"start":77.68,"duration":3.56,"text":"This is how we've done vision for a very"},{"start":79.08,"duration":3.96,"text":"long time."},{"start":81.24,"duration":3.16,"text":"Then comes the transformer. Again, I'm"},{"start":83.04,"duration":2.8,"text":"sure everyone is aware of how a"},{"start":84.4,"duration":2.92,"text":"transformer works, but just to"},{"start":85.84,"duration":5.12,"text":"summarize,"},{"start":87.32,"duration":6.64,"text":"we uh have a just a set of tokens."},{"start":90.96,"duration":5.32,"text":"We run a set-to-set operation."},{"start":93.96,"duration":4.6,"text":"So, there's no inductive bias. This is"},{"start":96.28,"duration":4.48,"text":"just an n-squared transformation."},{"start":98.56,"duration":4.24,"text":"We inject the inductive biases into the"},{"start":100.76,"duration":3.28,"text":"transformer. So, for example, a"},{"start":102.8,"duration":3.92,"text":"classical"},{"start":104.04,"duration":4.92,"text":"uh autoregressive transformer, we add a"},{"start":106.72,"duration":3.56,"text":"causal mask to the attention matrix"},{"start":108.96,"duration":4.52,"text":"matrix,"},{"start":110.28,"duration":7.48,"text":"and that gives us a sequential modeling."},{"start":113.48,"duration":4.28,"text":"Uh for vision,"},{"start":118.88,"duration":4.32,"text":"we have a vision transformer."},{"start":121.36,"duration":3.52,"text":"And this is"},{"start":123.2,"duration":3.56,"text":"very complicated."},{"start":124.88,"duration":4.76,"text":"A lot of engineering went into this. We"},{"start":126.76,"duration":4.48,"text":"take our image, we split it into"},{"start":129.64,"duration":4.48,"text":"uh patches."},{"start":131.24,"duration":4.48,"text":"16 by 16 was the original."},{"start":134.12,"duration":4.68,"text":"And"},{"start":135.72,"duration":3.96,"text":"we add a learned positional encoding,"},{"start":138.8,"duration":3.08,"text":"and then we throw that into a"},{"start":139.68,"duration":3.76,"text":"transformer,"},{"start":141.88,"duration":5.36,"text":"and that's it."},{"start":143.44,"duration":7.08,"text":"So, transformer is n-squared set-to-set."},{"start":147.24,"duration":4.52,"text":"We've got patches in our image."},{"start":150.52,"duration":3.76,"text":"This is uh"},{"start":151.76,"duration":2.52,"text":"we've got"},{"start":154.56,"duration":5.0,"text":"uh n over 16 patches for the side"},{"start":157.44,"duration":3.92,"text":"length, and and we end up actually with"},{"start":159.56,"duration":4.48,"text":"n to the fourth power"},{"start":161.36,"duration":4.44,"text":"with the resolution uh compute scaling."},{"start":164.04,"duration":4.4,"text":"We have no inductive bias."},{"start":165.8,"duration":3.84,"text":"The thing that is in the upper left can"},{"start":168.44,"duration":4.96,"text":"have a totally different activation"},{"start":169.64,"duration":6.16,"text":"pattern if it's in the bottom right."},{"start":173.4,"duration":3.6,"text":"And so, the question naturally arises,"},{"start":175.8,"duration":2.68,"text":"which is better?"},{"start":177.0,"duration":2.92,"text":"The high inductive bias n-squared"},{"start":178.48,"duration":3.12,"text":"convolutional network or the no"},{"start":179.92,"duration":3.6,"text":"inductive bias n to the fourth power"},{"start":181.6,"duration":4.32,"text":"VIT?"},{"start":183.52,"duration":5.28,"text":"So, as everyone would expect,"},{"start":185.92,"duration":2.88,"text":"it's the VIT."},{"start":189.12,"duration":3.72,"text":"So,"},{"start":190.52,"duration":4.36,"text":"how is this possible?"},{"start":192.84,"duration":3.96,"text":"And I'm I'm going to make the argument"},{"start":194.88,"duration":4.84,"text":"that it is because of massive"},{"start":196.8,"duration":5.2,"text":"VIT-specific pretraining,"},{"start":199.72,"duration":3.8,"text":"and then we get to borrow a lot of"},{"start":202.0,"duration":5.0,"text":"speedups and infrastructure from the"},{"start":203.52,"duration":3.48,"text":"fact that LLMs are blowing up."},{"start":207.2,"duration":3.68,"text":"So,"},{"start":209.12,"duration":3.0,"text":"to trace this evolution, we're going to"},{"start":210.88,"duration":2.68,"text":"talk about"},{"start":212.12,"duration":2.84,"text":"we we just talked about the introduction"},{"start":213.56,"duration":4.08,"text":"of the VIT,"},{"start":214.96,"duration":4.24,"text":"then how it how people tried to say,"},{"start":217.64,"duration":3.04,"text":"\"Okay, well, this this cannot possibly"},{"start":219.2,"duration":2.92,"text":"be the best thing that we can do. How do"},{"start":220.68,"duration":3.08,"text":"we make this better?\""},{"start":222.12,"duration":3.44,"text":"So, we go to Swin,"},{"start":223.76,"duration":5.24,"text":"then back to a a convolutional-based"},{"start":225.56,"duration":5.64,"text":"network, ConvNeXt, then uh Hera,"},{"start":229.0,"duration":3.84,"text":"um which I think is a"},{"start":231.2,"duration":4.2,"text":"kind of a ha- has some really really"},{"start":232.84,"duration":4.4,"text":"beautiful takeaways. And then,"},{"start":235.4,"duration":4.28,"text":"as always happens with machine learning,"},{"start":237.24,"duration":6.92,"text":"we come back better listen to the simple"},{"start":239.68,"duration":4.48,"text":"thing that scales well, the VIT."},{"start":245.2,"duration":2.92,"text":"So,"},{"start":246.44,"duration":3.8,"text":"uh"},{"start":248.12,"duration":5.28,"text":"first we're going to start with Swin."},{"start":250.24,"duration":5.12,"text":"So, we have this patchify operation,"},{"start":253.4,"duration":4.32,"text":"and"},{"start":255.36,"duration":4.12,"text":"we take our uh our patches, and we split"},{"start":257.72,"duration":2.96,"text":"them instead of doing global attention"},{"start":259.48,"duration":2.84,"text":"across all the patches at once, we just"},{"start":260.68,"duration":3.48,"text":"say, \"Okay, we're going to do attention"},{"start":262.32,"duration":3.24,"text":"this window.\""},{"start":264.16,"duration":4.52,"text":"If we just keep doing attention in this"},{"start":265.56,"duration":5.08,"text":"window, though, the the uh tokens will"},{"start":268.68,"duration":4.44,"text":"not be able to interact with each other."},{"start":270.64,"duration":3.84,"text":"So, these two will never see each other."},{"start":273.12,"duration":3.2,"text":"And so, the next layer, in fact, we"},{"start":274.48,"duration":3.44,"text":"shift the window a little bit. So, we've"},{"start":276.32,"duration":4.0,"text":"got these back-and-forth overlapping"},{"start":277.92,"duration":4.28,"text":"windows, and this looks very very"},{"start":280.32,"duration":3.16,"text":"similar to what I described with the"},{"start":282.2,"duration":3.16,"text":"convolution."},{"start":283.48,"duration":3.28,"text":"Yes, so we've got this uh"},{"start":285.36,"duration":2.96,"text":"similar-looking operation that is"},{"start":286.76,"duration":2.96,"text":"happening on these sections of the"},{"start":288.32,"duration":3.12,"text":"image,"},{"start":289.72,"duration":3.68,"text":"and uh"},{"start":291.44,"duration":3.76,"text":"then we end up with like overlap between"},{"start":293.4,"duration":4.92,"text":"the filters, the locations that they get"},{"start":295.2,"duration":5.52,"text":"applied on. And this is how we proceed."},{"start":298.32,"duration":4.96,"text":"And this actually gets us down to"},{"start":300.72,"duration":4.6,"text":"n-squared if your window size is"},{"start":303.28,"duration":3.84,"text":"independent of your resolution,"},{"start":305.32,"duration":3.16,"text":"and it adds a locality inductive bias"},{"start":307.12,"duration":2.96,"text":"following the convolutional net. So,"},{"start":308.48,"duration":2.84,"text":"that that seems logical. That makes"},{"start":310.08,"duration":3.88,"text":"sense."},{"start":311.32,"duration":4.64,"text":"Um"},{"start":313.96,"duration":3.84,"text":"then we go to the uh"},{"start":315.96,"duration":3.48,"text":"someone said,"},{"start":317.8,"duration":3.52,"text":"\"Okay, look, there's this transformer"},{"start":319.44,"duration":3.92,"text":"operation that has no inherent"},{"start":321.32,"duration":3.52,"text":"relationship with"},{"start":323.36,"duration":4.48,"text":"vision. Let's go back to the"},{"start":324.84,"duration":4.88,"text":"convolutional"},{"start":327.84,"duration":3.68,"text":"network. Let's take all the learnings"},{"start":329.72,"duration":3.4,"text":"that we've had from the vision"},{"start":331.52,"duration":2.76,"text":"transformers and just spit them into a"},{"start":333.12,"duration":2.88,"text":"convolutional network and see what do a"},{"start":334.28,"duration":2.6,"text":"patchify operation."},{"start":336.0,"duration":2.6,"text":"We do a"},{"start":336.88,"duration":3.76,"text":"I think it was a"},{"start":338.6,"duration":3.56,"text":"it was a 4 by 4 patch instead of a 16 by"},{"start":340.64,"duration":3.56,"text":"16 patch,"},{"start":342.16,"duration":4.28,"text":"and we're going to say,"},{"start":344.2,"duration":3.88,"text":"\"Our VIT was"},{"start":346.44,"duration":2.92,"text":"as all transformers,"},{"start":348.08,"duration":2.8,"text":"a"},{"start":349.36,"duration":4.0,"text":"self-attention feed-forward"},{"start":350.88,"duration":4.96,"text":"self-attention feed-forward etc."},{"start":353.36,"duration":4.0,"text":"And that self-attention is mixing your"},{"start":355.84,"duration":2.36,"text":"spatial information."},{"start":357.36,"duration":3.2,"text":"Okay?"},{"start":358.2,"duration":3.36,"text":"So, for the convolutional network, what"},{"start":360.56,"duration":2.28,"text":"if we just say, 'Okay, we're going to"},{"start":361.56,"duration":2.24,"text":"have the convolution mix the spatial"},{"start":362.84,"duration":2.28,"text":"information. We're going to do the same"},{"start":363.8,"duration":3.2,"text":"pattern."},{"start":365.12,"duration":3.52,"text":"Uh mixer,"},{"start":367.0,"duration":2.88,"text":"feed-forward mixer feed-forward"},{"start":368.64,"duration":2.68,"text":"onwards.' And we're going to borrow the"},{"start":369.88,"duration":3.0,"text":"same hierarchical structure that"},{"start":371.32,"duration":3.64,"text":"everyone has been using for these"},{"start":372.88,"duration":3.88,"text":"convolutional networks.\""},{"start":374.96,"duration":3.4,"text":"And uh"},{"start":376.76,"duration":4.16,"text":"also throw in layer norm and a couple"},{"start":378.36,"duration":4.28,"text":"other innovations, and that's it. We're"},{"start":380.92,"duration":4.88,"text":"going to try that. Turns out that beats"},{"start":382.64,"duration":5.84,"text":"VIT and Swin when you apply it on the uh"},{"start":385.8,"duration":4.72,"text":"standard ImageNet"},{"start":388.48,"duration":3.68,"text":"reference."},{"start":390.52,"duration":4.68,"text":"That's great. Finally, we have something"},{"start":392.16,"duration":3.04,"text":"that makes a little bit of sense."},{"start":395.44,"duration":5.64,"text":"Um"},{"start":397.16,"duration":3.92,"text":"turns out that's not super fast."},{"start":401.28,"duration":3.64,"text":"So,"},{"start":402.48,"duration":3.76,"text":"someone uh Meta decided, \"Okay, what"},{"start":404.92,"duration":3.68,"text":"what what are what are the actual"},{"start":406.24,"duration":3.88,"text":"important things here? The ConvNeXt has"},{"start":408.6,"duration":3.92,"text":"a bunch of these beautiful inductive"},{"start":410.12,"duration":5.64,"text":"biases. It's following this formula that"},{"start":412.52,"duration":5.52,"text":"we got from the transformer."},{"start":415.76,"duration":4.84,"text":"Let's look at what those inductive"},{"start":418.04,"duration":4.36,"text":"biases are actually useful for. So,"},{"start":420.6,"duration":3.72,"text":"we're going to take a really really good"},{"start":422.4,"duration":3.32,"text":"inductively biased transformer model."},{"start":424.32,"duration":3.24,"text":"We're going to strip out the biases one"},{"start":425.72,"duration":2.64,"text":"at a time. We're going to get a speedup"},{"start":427.56,"duration":2.88,"text":"because we don't have all the"},{"start":428.36,"duration":3.84,"text":"specialized equipment anymore for the"},{"start":430.44,"duration":4.36,"text":"inductive bias, and we're going to use"},{"start":432.2,"duration":4.56,"text":"pretraining to learn the bias instead.\""},{"start":434.8,"duration":4.52,"text":"So, this is I think a really really"},{"start":436.76,"duration":5.52,"text":"great example of the balance between"},{"start":439.32,"duration":4.56,"text":"pretraining and inherent inductive bias,"},{"start":442.28,"duration":4.44,"text":"which ends up being how transformers"},{"start":443.88,"duration":3.44,"text":"ultimately win out. Here we're using uh"},{"start":446.72,"duration":2.96,"text":"uh"},{"start":447.32,"duration":3.84,"text":"MAE, masked autoencoder,"},{"start":449.68,"duration":2.84,"text":"um for those of you who are not"},{"start":451.16,"duration":2.28,"text":"familiar,"},{"start":452.52,"duration":2.4,"text":"you take your image, you take your"},{"start":453.44,"duration":4.48,"text":"patches, you drop a bunch of the"},{"start":454.92,"duration":4.88,"text":"patches, and you ask the"},{"start":457.92,"duration":3.44,"text":"the model to reconstruct what would have"},{"start":459.8,"duration":4.28,"text":"been in the patches"},{"start":461.36,"duration":4.68,"text":"just based on the context."},{"start":464.08,"duration":3.2,"text":"Very very similar to BERT"},{"start":466.04,"duration":2.96,"text":"for those of you who come from the"},{"start":467.28,"duration":3.2,"text":"language space."},{"start":469.0,"duration":3.6,"text":"Uh"},{"start":470.48,"duration":3.6,"text":"you do this at scale, and it turns out"},{"start":472.6,"duration":3.24,"text":"the model actually learns back the"},{"start":474.08,"duration":4.84,"text":"inductive biases."},{"start":475.84,"duration":5.16,"text":"But, you can't actually apply MAE to a"},{"start":478.92,"duration":3.68,"text":"convolutional network. How do you drop"},{"start":481.0,"duration":3.24,"text":"out a patch when you're doing this"},{"start":482.6,"duration":2.96,"text":"convolution that's invariant across"},{"start":484.24,"duration":3.84,"text":"patches?"},{"start":485.56,"duration":4.68,"text":"So, it's a VIT-specific"},{"start":488.08,"duration":3.4,"text":"uh pretraining technique that adds"},{"start":490.24,"duration":3.84,"text":"inductive bias that would otherwise be"},{"start":491.48,"duration":4.2,"text":"missing from the structure."},{"start":494.08,"duration":2.52,"text":"Um"},{"start":495.68,"duration":4.52,"text":"So, that's great. That's super"},{"start":496.6,"duration":5.52,"text":"interesting. That That works nicely."},{"start":500.2,"duration":3.72,"text":"Turns out it doesn't You can take that"},{"start":502.12,"duration":5.28,"text":"to an extreme,"},{"start":503.92,"duration":5.76,"text":"and you throw in DINOv2, DINOv3,"},{"start":507.4,"duration":4.48,"text":"these really"},{"start":509.68,"duration":3.64,"text":"again, VIT-specific pretraining"},{"start":511.88,"duration":2.88,"text":"techniques,"},{"start":513.32,"duration":2.92,"text":"and you"},{"start":514.76,"duration":3.0,"text":"at the end of it don't just have these"},{"start":516.24,"duration":3.04,"text":"inductive biases towards how to process"},{"start":517.76,"duration":3.76,"text":"an image. You actually have"},{"start":519.28,"duration":4.36,"text":"really really really fit uh"},{"start":521.52,"duration":4.16,"text":"rich feature maps out of the box."},{"start":523.64,"duration":3.76,"text":"So, for example, this is a PCA"},{"start":525.68,"duration":5.2,"text":"decomposition of the feature maps"},{"start":527.4,"duration":6.88,"text":"produced by a DINOv3 pretrained VIT,"},{"start":530.88,"duration":5.64,"text":"and we see that the paws of the cat have"},{"start":534.28,"duration":3.96,"text":"different colors, and that it's tracing"},{"start":536.52,"duration":3.24,"text":"the paws correctly for each of the"},{"start":538.24,"duration":3.24,"text":"different cats."},{"start":539.76,"duration":4.12,"text":"The satellite imagery is decomposed in a"},{"start":541.48,"duration":4.04,"text":"way that is semantically meaningful."},{"start":543.88,"duration":3.28,"text":"And uh in fact, the self-supervised"},{"start":545.52,"duration":4.28,"text":"learning objective is is catching up"},{"start":547.16,"duration":4.12,"text":"with the best that we have from"},{"start":549.8,"duration":3.24,"text":"supervised learning,"},{"start":551.28,"duration":3.12,"text":"and this is via linear probe. So, you"},{"start":553.04,"duration":3.0,"text":"have your frozen features, you're just"},{"start":554.4,"duration":2.52,"text":"probing into them."},{"start":556.04,"duration":2.88,"text":"You're not training anything"},{"start":556.92,"duration":4.6,"text":"specifically on your data except for"},{"start":558.92,"duration":4.64,"text":"that linear projection at the end,"},{"start":561.52,"duration":3.6,"text":"and you're getting very very very close"},{"start":563.56,"duration":5.44,"text":"to the best that we know how to do with"},{"start":565.12,"duration":5.16,"text":"self- with uh fully supervised learning."},{"start":569.0,"duration":4.72,"text":"Okay, but what about the speed issue?"},{"start":570.28,"duration":5.68,"text":"This is still n to the fourth power."},{"start":573.72,"duration":5.12,"text":"Uh"},{"start":575.96,"duration":5.24,"text":"it turns out that people"},{"start":578.84,"duration":3.92,"text":"are care a lot about attention. So, in"},{"start":581.2,"duration":4.32,"text":"the LLM world, we start introducing"},{"start":582.76,"duration":4.04,"text":"these tools, uh flash attention,"},{"start":585.52,"duration":2.68,"text":"the biggest one,"},{"start":586.8,"duration":3.52,"text":"and"},{"start":588.2,"duration":4.2,"text":"uh Hera"},{"start":590.32,"duration":4.88,"text":"explicitly showed a speedup for the same"},{"start":592.4,"duration":4.68,"text":"accuracy versus VIT, but they have a"},{"start":595.2,"duration":3.48,"text":"note in their paper where they where"},{"start":597.08,"duration":4.16,"text":"they say, \"Okay,"},{"start":598.68,"duration":4.16,"text":"we see the speed up"},{"start":601.24,"duration":4.28,"text":"and we're not going to measure with"},{"start":602.84,"duration":2.68,"text":"flash attention.\""},{"start":606.24,"duration":2.44,"text":"So, then you add back in flash"},{"start":607.64,"duration":2.0,"text":"attention, suddenly it doesn't really"},{"start":608.68,"duration":2.64,"text":"matter."},{"start":609.64,"duration":4.72,"text":"You've got you're back to this very"},{"start":611.32,"duration":5.4,"text":"silly ends end of the fourth power thing"},{"start":614.36,"duration":4.16,"text":"that benefits from this VIT specific"},{"start":616.72,"duration":5.04,"text":"pre-training method,"},{"start":618.52,"duration":3.24,"text":"and that's it. We're"},{"start":622.28,"duration":3.96,"text":"uh we've kind of we're we're we've kind"},{"start":624.36,"duration":3.72,"text":"of won."},{"start":626.24,"duration":4.16,"text":"So,"},{"start":628.08,"duration":4.12,"text":"this is a a talk about this is a an"},{"start":630.4,"duration":3.08,"text":"evolution of the backbones. How it is"},{"start":632.2,"duration":3.52,"text":"how it is that the end of the fourth"},{"start":633.48,"duration":4.68,"text":"thing ended up beating out everyone that"},{"start":635.72,"duration":4.2,"text":"tried to beat it."},{"start":638.16,"duration":4.48,"text":"What does this mean in"},{"start":639.92,"duration":6.96,"text":"practice and application? So,"},{"start":642.64,"duration":6.12,"text":"SAM is a very famous series of models."},{"start":646.88,"duration":5.0,"text":"Again, if I I I don't know where people"},{"start":648.76,"duration":4.68,"text":"come from, but SAM was a"},{"start":651.88,"duration":5.44,"text":"what from my perspective one of the most"},{"start":653.44,"duration":6.28,"text":"important uh foundation model series in"},{"start":657.32,"duration":4.64,"text":"vision period."},{"start":659.72,"duration":5.72,"text":"And we actually see the same pattern."},{"start":661.96,"duration":4.72,"text":"So, SAM to mobile SAM to SAM 2 to SAM 3,"},{"start":665.44,"duration":3.4,"text":"if you look at the backbones that are"},{"start":666.68,"duration":3.44,"text":"underlying it, it's a VIT trained with"},{"start":668.84,"duration":2.88,"text":"MAE."},{"start":670.12,"duration":2.96,"text":"Then someone says, \"Okay, well, surely"},{"start":671.72,"duration":4.04,"text":"this cannot be the best that we can do.\""},{"start":673.08,"duration":5.68,"text":"So, they uh mobile SAM actually uses"},{"start":675.76,"duration":6.0,"text":"a specialized convolutional transformer"},{"start":678.76,"duration":4.84,"text":"hybrid uh called tiny VIT and replaces"},{"start":681.76,"duration":4.88,"text":"the the VIT backbone."},{"start":683.6,"duration":5.2,"text":"And then SAM 2 actually uses Hera"},{"start":686.64,"duration":5.2,"text":"with uh this MAE pre-training,"},{"start":688.8,"duration":4.36,"text":"and then SAM 3 just gives up on the"},{"start":691.84,"duration":3.12,"text":"architecture ablation and just says,"},{"start":693.16,"duration":3.24,"text":"\"Okay, well, we've got this massively"},{"start":694.96,"duration":4.16,"text":"pre-trained"},{"start":696.4,"duration":4.8,"text":"backbone. Let's just stick it in. That's"},{"start":699.12,"duration":4.68,"text":"the best that we can do.\""},{"start":701.2,"duration":4.68,"text":"Um"},{"start":703.8,"duration":4.36,"text":"So, that's all good and fine, but where"},{"start":705.88,"duration":4.12,"text":"does that actually leave us?"},{"start":708.16,"duration":4.88,"text":"Um"},{"start":710.0,"duration":4.76,"text":"this is really expensive if we're"},{"start":713.04,"duration":3.76,"text":"relying on these huge pre-training"},{"start":714.76,"duration":3.76,"text":"strategies in order to recover the"},{"start":716.8,"duration":3.52,"text":"performance that is lost due to the fact"},{"start":718.52,"duration":3.96,"text":"that our architecture is not biased"},{"start":720.32,"duration":3.48,"text":"towards the subject at all."},{"start":722.48,"duration":2.96,"text":"Uh that means we have to spend a huge"},{"start":723.8,"duration":3.56,"text":"amount of money every time we want to do"},{"start":725.44,"duration":4.84,"text":"a deployment."},{"start":727.36,"duration":5.44,"text":"So, no deployment flexibility means that"},{"start":730.28,"duration":4.12,"text":"we have these one-size-fits-all models."},{"start":732.8,"duration":2.76,"text":"So, SAM 3"},{"start":734.4,"duration":3.24,"text":"is this"},{"start":735.56,"duration":4.52,"text":"very very powerful thing, but is also"},{"start":737.64,"duration":5.4,"text":"800 million parameters. It takes 300"},{"start":740.08,"duration":4.48,"text":"milliseconds to run on a T4 GPU."},{"start":743.04,"duration":4.24,"text":"It's not"},{"start":744.56,"duration":4.36,"text":"actually usable in a lot of cases,"},{"start":747.28,"duration":2.84,"text":"uh especially because vision"},{"start":748.92,"duration":3.52,"text":"historically has been focused on these"},{"start":750.12,"duration":4.72,"text":"very low-power edge devices,"},{"start":752.44,"duration":4.24,"text":"these uh resource constrained deployment"},{"start":754.84,"duration":3.44,"text":"scenarios."},{"start":756.68,"duration":5.12,"text":"So,"},{"start":758.28,"duration":6.4,"text":"uh at Roboflow, what we have done"},{"start":761.8,"duration":5.64,"text":"is we've attempted to say,"},{"start":764.68,"duration":5.12,"text":"\"How do we actually take these"},{"start":767.44,"duration":3.88,"text":"fixed foundation models"},{"start":769.8,"duration":4.16,"text":"and to transform them into something"},{"start":771.32,"duration":4.08,"text":"that has flexibility?\""},{"start":773.96,"duration":4.84,"text":"So,"},{"start":775.4,"duration":6.04,"text":"we introduce a data set, RF100VL, that"},{"start":778.8,"duration":4.0,"text":"measures how well"},{"start":781.44,"duration":4.16,"text":"uh"},{"start":782.8,"duration":4.72,"text":"foundation models transfer to downstream"},{"start":785.6,"duration":3.56,"text":"diverse tasks with respect to object"},{"start":787.52,"duration":3.68,"text":"detection, which is"},{"start":789.16,"duration":3.72,"text":"one of the canonical vision-centric"},{"start":791.2,"duration":3.92,"text":"tasks."},{"start":792.88,"duration":5.0,"text":"And we see"},{"start":795.12,"duration":5.88,"text":"about a 40x speed up for the same"},{"start":797.88,"duration":6.64,"text":"accuracy versus fine-tuning SAM 3,"},{"start":801.0,"duration":5.92,"text":"uh and for merely a 15x speed up, we get"},{"start":804.52,"duration":4.72,"text":"a a meaningful improvement."},{"start":806.92,"duration":5.8,"text":"Um"},{"start":809.24,"duration":4.96,"text":"So, this combination of this huge"},{"start":812.72,"duration":4.12,"text":"advancement in foundation model"},{"start":814.2,"duration":3.96,"text":"pre-training and these strong deployment"},{"start":816.84,"duration":3.48,"text":"methods"},{"start":818.16,"duration":4.0,"text":"combined with uh"},{"start":820.32,"duration":4.08,"text":"an actual ability to deploy these in"},{"start":822.16,"duration":3.72,"text":"hardware constrained environments ends"},{"start":824.4,"duration":3.04,"text":"up being the"},{"start":825.88,"duration":3.6,"text":"uh"},{"start":827.44,"duration":4.6,"text":"uh final nail in the coffin for these"},{"start":829.48,"duration":4.92,"text":"classical convolutional-based methods."},{"start":832.04,"duration":4.4,"text":"Uh these at the time of our publication"},{"start":834.4,"duration":5.6,"text":"of RFDetR,"},{"start":836.44,"duration":5.96,"text":"these were the best convolutional"},{"start":840.0,"duration":5.6,"text":"uh these were the best real-time"},{"start":842.4,"duration":5.68,"text":"instance segmentation models, and we uh"},{"start":845.6,"duration":3.88,"text":"we we we we outperformed them in a in a"},{"start":848.08,"duration":3.52,"text":"meaningful way."},{"start":849.48,"duration":2.12,"text":"Uh"},{"start":852.48,"duration":4.44,"text":"Um and so, this is all those models on"},{"start":855.36,"duration":3.0,"text":"that line use actually the same"},{"start":856.92,"duration":3.88,"text":"foundation model."},{"start":858.36,"duration":4.4,"text":"We just modify the foundation model"},{"start":860.8,"duration":3.96,"text":"using neural architecture search"},{"start":862.76,"duration":3.24,"text":"such that we generate an entire family"},{"start":864.76,"duration":6.12,"text":"of"},{"start":866.0,"duration":6.52,"text":"uh high-performance models in in one go."},{"start":870.88,"duration":4.48,"text":"To do this, we actually introduce a"},{"start":872.52,"duration":5.64,"text":"bunch of uh flexible knobs. All of these"},{"start":875.36,"duration":5.68,"text":"are drop-in compatible with the existing"},{"start":878.16,"duration":5.68,"text":"foundation model infrastructure,"},{"start":881.04,"duration":4.88,"text":"and by mixing and matching them in a way"},{"start":883.84,"duration":3.8,"text":"that is dependent on target data and"},{"start":885.92,"duration":3.08,"text":"target hardware,"},{"start":887.64,"duration":4.8,"text":"we can uh"},{"start":889.0,"duration":5.64,"text":"resolve the issue that"},{"start":892.44,"duration":5.04,"text":"uh these foundation models do not have"},{"start":894.64,"duration":4.44,"text":"deployment flexibility."},{"start":897.48,"duration":5.08,"text":"Um"},{"start":899.08,"duration":7.36,"text":"So, massive VIT specific pre-training"},{"start":902.56,"duration":5.24,"text":"plus speed ups from LLMs plus"},{"start":906.44,"duration":3.0,"text":"uh pre-training compatible neural"},{"start":907.8,"duration":3.92,"text":"architecture search,"},{"start":909.44,"duration":4.84,"text":"and uh"},{"start":911.72,"duration":2.56,"text":"that's it."},{"start":922.36,"duration":3.6,"text":"Do we have architectures that support"},{"start":924.32,"duration":5.28,"text":"like video or"},{"start":925.96,"duration":5.12,"text":"video plus image plus text pre-training"},{"start":929.6,"duration":3.48,"text":"already?"},{"start":931.08,"duration":4.8,"text":"Is someone working on that?"},{"start":933.08,"duration":4.28,"text":"So,"},{"start":935.88,"duration":2.56,"text":"there are a lot of people working on"},{"start":937.36,"duration":2.72,"text":"like a huge amount of different"},{"start":938.44,"duration":4.96,"text":"combinations of things. I actually think"},{"start":940.08,"duration":5.8,"text":"SAM 3 is a good example of that. They do"},{"start":943.4,"duration":4.84,"text":"Well, in terms of"},{"start":945.88,"duration":3.84,"text":"in terms of vision-specific video"},{"start":948.24,"duration":4.16,"text":"processing,"},{"start":949.72,"duration":3.96,"text":"it does video processing in the in from"},{"start":952.4,"duration":3.08,"text":"the perspective of tracking objects"},{"start":953.68,"duration":4.08,"text":"through video."},{"start":955.48,"duration":3.84,"text":"So, they do massive-scale pre-training."},{"start":957.76,"duration":2.88,"text":"They do the perception encoder"},{"start":959.32,"duration":2.76,"text":"pre-training for the backbone, and then"},{"start":960.64,"duration":3.56,"text":"they do a huge amount of downstream"},{"start":962.08,"duration":2.92,"text":"pre-training."},{"start":964.2,"duration":2.48,"text":"Or I guess you would just call it"},{"start":965.0,"duration":3.16,"text":"training at that point."},{"start":966.68,"duration":3.76,"text":"Um"},{"start":968.16,"duration":7.4,"text":"What about JEPA like Yeah, the video"},{"start":970.44,"duration":5.12,"text":"Yeah, JEPA and the VJEPA, those are uh"},{"start":975.64,"duration":3.44,"text":"I mean, yeah, those are another variety"},{"start":977.24,"duration":3.48,"text":"of foundation model. I think in terms of"},{"start":979.08,"duration":4.68,"text":"single"},{"start":980.72,"duration":5.36,"text":"like image-centric pre-training,"},{"start":983.76,"duration":3.76,"text":"JEPA doesn't seem to outperform a lot of"},{"start":986.08,"duration":3.88,"text":"the other ones."},{"start":987.52,"duration":4.68,"text":"Video JEPA,"},{"start":989.96,"duration":4.68,"text":"I haven't seen anyone use it"},{"start":992.2,"duration":4.84,"text":"meaningfully in a video context for"},{"start":994.64,"duration":4.28,"text":"downstream transfer yet, but"},{"start":997.04,"duration":3.76,"text":"you know, we'll see. Yeah."},{"start":998.92,"duration":4.56,"text":"Yeah."},{"start":1000.8,"duration":2.68,"text":"Any other questions?"},{"start":1003.6,"duration":3.56,"text":"Cool."},{"start":1004.88,"duration":2.28,"text":"Okay."}]}